# The Legacy of Civil Rights in the Every Student Succeeds Act. Equity Dispatch. Volume 1, Issue 4

**Authors:** Coomer, M. Nickie, Pearce, Nick, Dagli, Cesar, Skelton, Seena M., Kyser, Tiffany S., Thorius, Kathleen King

## Abstract
This issue of &quot;Equity Dispatch&quot; examines national education policy as it moves from development to implementation, the impact local actors can have on upholding the original intent of policy, and the ways administrators and educators can critically examine policy implementation in order to ensure equitable opportunities for students.

